      "canonicalName": "tarot.major.overview.the-fool",
      "entityType": "system.overview",
      "primaryDisplayName": "The Fool",
      "description": "The Fool as rendered across the four supported decks. In the Tarot de Marseille he is Le Mat — the unnumbered wanderer outside the sequence. Thoth retains the name and Crowley's imagery of the Green Man. Etteilla has no equivalent; he replaced the position with 'Etteilla — The Questioner', making the Fool unique to the three Hermetic decks.",
